  "source_identity": "Mathesis public projection",
  "work": {
    "abstract_text": "We prove the recurrence and D-finiteness conjectured by R. J. Mathar in OEIS A386829, FORMULA 5, revision 11 (2 November 2026), approved as revision 12. Its generating function is (7/sqrt(1-20z)-3)/(4+18z). A two-weight algebraic family proves the displayed recurrence conjectures in A386830 for n>=2 and A386831 for n>=4, and the exponential, reversion and hypergeometric identities in related entries. Coverage distinguishes written proofs, exact polynomial identities, finite coefficient checks and the pinned Lean declaration.",
